Ceilings for this target size
------------------------------------------------------------------------
  whole-frame inference   up to    0.7 m AGL
  tiled inference         up to    5.1 m AGL  (7.2x higher, at 52x the inference cost)

  Above the tiled ceiling the object is not in the image in any useful
  sense. No model recovers it: you need a longer lens, a higher-resolution
  sensor, or a lower flight.

  Note these are optics ceilings, not recommendations. Motion blur,
  focus and lighting all degrade real detection well before the limit.
